---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="How comments and visitor data are handled on this personal site."
>
  <header class="page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">A little transparency</p>
    <h1>Your privacy matters.</h1>
    <p>
      This is a personal site. Here’s what happens when you visit or leave a
      comment.
    </p>
  </header>
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Reading the site</h2>
    <p>
      The site uses Cloudflare to deliver pages and media. Cloudflare processes
      request information for delivery, security, and operational logs. There
      are no advertising trackers or third-party analytics installed.
    </p>
    <p>
      Your color theme preference is saved in your browser. Administrator
      sessions use cookies; reading public content does not require an account.
    </p>
    <h2>Leaving a comment</h2>
    <p>
      Your display name and approved comment are public. Your email address is
      private, accessible only for site administration and comment moderation.
      Comments also store a site-specific hash of your IP address and browser
      request information for rate limiting and abuse handling.
    </p>
    <p>
      Cloudflare Turnstile is used to verify comment submissions. No comment
      becomes public until it is reviewed. Comment data remains until the
      comment is removed by the site owner.
    </p>
    <h2>Questions or removal requests</h2>
    <p>
      Use the contact links on the About page to ask about a comment or request
      its removal.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
